sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as Gateway / Policy
    participant A as Admission / DB
    participant R as Router / Adapter
    participant W as vLLM worker
    C->>G: POST chat + scoped key
    G->>R: Validate profile / context
    R->>A: Reserve candidate + quota
    A-->>R: Committed attempt + fence
    R->>W: Bounded invoke / deadline
    W-->>R: Text chunks or full result
    R-->>G: Normalized response / chunks
    G-->>C: JSON or SSE chunks
    R->>A: Settle usage / verified finish
    G-->>C: Successful completion / DONE
    Note over C,W: ALT: partial-stream failure -> error + close; never splice a new node into this stream
